# Every branch adds its one line at the top of the current section, so two
# branches finishing close together conflict here and nowhere else. Union keeps
# both lines instead of stopping the merge — the resolution a human made by
# hand for eight items on 2026-08-25.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union

